## cutoff-search.soar -- agent-world: 1 proposal, 2 compares, 1 application.

## ---- operator proposal ----

## Propose cutoff-search.
## Did not really help
sp {agent-world*propose*evaluate-operator*cutoff-search
   :default
   (state <s> ###qui### ^quiescence t  ### TEST
              ^selection-superstate <superstate>
              ^world.path-cost { <world-time> > <mnv> })
   (<superstate> ^evaluation <evaluation>
                 ^operator <superoperator>
                 ^minimum-numeric-value $ <mnv>)
   (<superoperator> ^super-operator.name $ <name>
                    ^evaluation <evaluation>)
  -(<evaluation> ^numeric-value <mnv>)  # waste of time if this is the one...
  -(<superstate> ^superstate.desireds.better higher)  # the minimum is meaningful only when lower is better
-->
   (log 1 (crlf) <s> |: | <name> | --Pass back (failure cutoff)-- world-time: | <world-time> | > minimum: | <mnv>)
   (<s> ^operator <op> + =, >)
   (<op> ^name cutoff-search
         ^evaluation <evaluation>)
}

## ---- evaluate / compare ----

## Preference for evaluate-operator cutoff-search.
sp {agent-world*compare*evaluate-operator*cutoff-search
   :default
   (state <s> ^operator <op1> +
                        { <> <op1> <op2> }  +)
   (<op1> ^name cutoff-search)
   (<op2> ^task-operator true)
-->
   (<s> ^operator <op1> > <op2>)
}

## Preference for evaluate-operator cutoff-search2.
sp {agent-world*compare*evaluate-operator*cutoff-search2
   :default
   (state <s> ^operator <op1> +
                        { <> <op1> <op2> }  +)
   (<op1> ^name cutoff-search)
   (<op2> ^name find-object)
-->
   (<s> ^operator <op1> > <op2>)
}

## ---- operator application ----

## Apply cutoff-search -> sets failure-cutoff.
sp {agent-world*apply*cutoff-search
   :default
   (state <s> ^operator <op>
              ^selection-superstate <superstate>)
   (<op> ^name cutoff-search
         ^evaluation <evaluation>)
   (<superstate> ^evaluation <evaluation>)
   (<evaluation> ^lower-bound $ <lower-bound>)   # v2.30: the chunk tests this bound literally (none: no cut-off below)
-->
   (log 1 (crlf) |Cutoff-search Evaluation: | <evaluation>)
   (<evaluation> ^failure-cutoff true
                 ^value true)
}
